  "story": {
    "text": "“You {PIERCE} my soul. I am half {AGONY}, half hope. Tell me not that I am too {LATE}.” Wentworth finds Anne in the street, and on the quiet {GRAVEL} walk they are {REUNITED}, wiser than eight years ago. Mr. Elliot runs off with Mrs. Clay, Sir Walter consents, and Anne becomes a {SAILOR}’s {BRIDE}, glad to pay the tax of quick alarm.",
